{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is a classic survival experience featuring a mix of PvP and PvE, set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast <strong>open-world map</strong> made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones \u2013 surrounded by dense jungle, untouched wilderness, and an atmosphere that constantly shifts between beauty and danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dangerous AI Dinosaurs</strong><br>The islands are far from uninhabited \u2013 prehistoric beasts roam the jungles. Sneak, fight, or flee \u2013 survival is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790650?t=1749834950","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/bf9eedf87b627508b34c5e857865043175d6eabc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749834950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/532d1d0d1e40d2c408a61bcf9533350a3710e31b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749834950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/532d1d0d1e40d2c408a61bcf9533350a3710e31b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749834950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is a classic survival experience featuring a mix of PvP and PvE, set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast <strong>open-world map</strong> made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones \u2013 surrounded by dense jungle, untouched wilderness, and an atmosphere that constantly shifts between beauty and danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dangerous AI Dinosaurs</strong><br>The islands are far from uninhabited \u2013 prehistoric beasts roam the jungles. Sneak, fight, or flee \u2013 survival is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","developers":["HolyMaskGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/44c34a4b6fe1d8c8cd00e1df76712ffa735456d1/header.jpg?t=1749834950","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Mesorift Survival","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requir